<Base
  title="Research Projects — Chance B. Ronemus"
  description="Ongoing and recent research projects: forearc basins and terrane accretion in Chile, Andean and Rocky Mountain foreland basin evolution, crustal thickness proxies, and stable isotope paleoaltimetry."
